      "content": "The wording looks good, but I'm looking at the internal fatigue metrics from the last two weeks. The data shows driver alertness levels are dropping significantly during the middle of these new blocks, and several drivers have reported near-misses due to exhaustion. How can we claim \"highest levels of well-being\" and \"rigorous adherence\" when the actual data shows they're hitting fatigue thresholds?",
